#. module: om_quality_mrp
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_quality_mrp
msgid ""
"\n"
"Quality checks in manufacturing: control points on manufacturing orders, on operations and work\n"
"centres create their checks when the order is confirmed: one per order, one per work order step,\n"
"or one per finished lot or serial number at production. A blocking check holds Produce and the\n"
"end of its work order until it passes or a quality manager overrides it. A failed check raises a\n"
"non-conformance, puts the finished lot on hold, and offers scrap or rework.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: om_quality_mrp
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_quality_mrp.field_om_quality_check__production_state
msgid ""
" * Draft: The MO is not confirmed yet.\n"
" * Confirmed: The MO is confirmed, the stock rules and the reordering of the components are trigerred.\n"
" * In Progress: The production has started (on the MO or on the WO).\n"
" * To Close: The production is done, the MO has to be closed.\n"
" * Done: The MO is closed, the stock moves are posted. \n"
" * Cancelled: The MO has been cancelled, can't be confirmed anymore."
msgstr ""

